  "behavior_observed": [
    "Real native local workspaces simulate laptop/devbox/Boat priorities and return to a fresh laptop workspace; counter checkpoints progress without overwriting old directories.",
    "Stale epoch retry/publication refusal, exact current retry pinned despite changed availability, confirmed-stop refusal and explicit external-fencing assertion.",
    "Before-write Restored/LaunchRequested/Started and after-commit Started error injection reopen real FileStateRepository; no claim before durable launch intent; one counter increment and no restore over post-launch sentinel.",
    "Actual native open and actual first archive staging write are gated, then caller aborted: concurrent request conflicts, owned operation completes transfer cleanup and one launch, exact retry reuses RunRef.",
    "Attached project rejected before restore; transient credentials absent from authority fingerprint/plaintext while native salted claim rejects rebound transient launch inputs.",
    "Memory and real file CAS have one concurrent winner, stale/invalid writes preserve file bytes, ordinary workflow save cannot bypass recovery CAS, v1/v2 migration preserves sync/handoff records."
  ],
